      "start": 1490,
      "end": 1627,
      "level": 2,
      "text_preview": "·\nConverted by carbonic anhydrase and\nbuffered\no\nCO\n2\n+ H\n2\nO <-> H\n+\n+\nHCO\n3\n-\no\nCO\n2\n+ NH\n2\n<-> NH",
