      "end": 1627,
      "level": 3,
      "text_preview": "o\nCO\n2\n+ H\n2\nO <-> H\n+\n+\nHCO\n3\n-\no\nCO\n2\n+ NH\n2\n<-> NHCOO\n-\n+ H\n+\no\nKHb + H\n+\n<-> HHb +\nK\n+",
